---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  lang="en"
  title="TractorVS | Tractor Specifications & Comparisons"
  description="A modern agricultural machinery platform designed to make tractor specifications clearer, more comparable and easier to verify."
>
  <section class="hero-section">
    <div class="hero-grid"></div>
    <div class="container hero-layout">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-mark"></span> AGRICULTURAL MACHINERY INTELLIGENCE</p>
        <h1>Choose your next tractor with <em>clarity.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-lede">
          Tractor specifications can be complicated. We are building a clearer way to explore,
          understand and compare the details that matter.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="/tractors/">Browse tractor catalogue <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="#approach">How we approach the data <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-assurance">
          <span class="assurance-icon">✓</span>
          <span>Designed for source-backed specifications and careful review.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-art" aria-label="Illustration of a technical tractor profile and specification categories" role="img">
        <div class="art-topline">
          <span>FIELD INTELLIGENCE / 001</span>
          <span class="live-indicator"><i></i> DATA-LED DESIGN</span>
        </div>
        <div class="tractor-illustration">
          <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div>
          <div class="orbit orbit-two"></div>
          <svg class="tractor-svg" viewBox="0 0 520 310" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M75 215h307l36-58h-78l-34-83h-96l-25 75H115l-40 66Z" fill="#243c30" stroke="#a8c5a5" stroke-width="2.3"/>
            <path d="M211 75h95l33 82H191l20-82Z" fill="#52745a" stroke="#b9d3b3" stroke-width="2.3"/>
            <path d="M230 87h64l21 57h-98l13-57Z" fill="#a9c8ad" fill-opacity=".26"/>
            <path d="M115 149h90v66H75l40-66Z" fill="#314b3b" stroke="#a8c5a5" stroke-width="2.3"/>
            <path d="M338 157h80l-36 58h-20l-24-58Z" fill="#314b3b" stroke="#a8c5a5" stroke-width="2.3"/>
            <path d="M193 77h113" stroke="#d7e7d4" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M183 155h156M118 175h66" stroke="#91af91" stroke-width="2" opacity=".75"/>
            <path d="M384 157v-25h24v25" stroke="#a8c5a5" stroke-width="2.2"/>
            <circle cx="147" cy="222" r="53" fill="#111b16" stroke="#a8c5a5" stroke-width="4"/>
            <circle cx="147" cy="222" r="28" fill="#345340" stroke="#d1e1cd" stroke-width="2.5"/>
            <circle cx="365" cy="222" r="37" fill="#111b16" stroke="#a8c5a5" stroke-width="4"/>
            <circle cx="365" cy="222" r="18" fill="#345340" stroke="#d1e1cd" stroke-width="2.5"/>
            <path d="M64 275h354" stroke="#77917c" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".55"/>
            <path d="M95 261h260" stroke="#77917c" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 8" opacity=".6"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="art-coordinate coordinate-a">40° 11' N</span>
          <span class="art-coordinate coordinate-b">TECH / 04</span>
          <span class="art-cross cross-a">+</span>
          <span class="art-cross cross-b">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="art-bottomline">
          <div><small>ENGINE</small><strong>Power & efficiency</strong></div>
          <div><small>DRIVELINE</small><strong>Transmission & PTO</strong></div>
          <div><small>HYDRAULICS</small><strong>Flow & lift capacity</strong></div>
        </div>
        <span class="art-corner">01 — 03</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container hero-footnote">
      <span>BUILT FOR BETTER MACHINE DECISIONS</span>
      <span>TECHNICAL DEPTH / PRACTICAL CLARITY</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="intro-section section-space" id="platform">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-mark"></span> A BETTER WAY TO COMPARE</p>
        <h2>More than numbers.<br /><em>Context that matters.</em></h2>
        <p class="section-summary">
          A specification only becomes useful when you can understand what it means,
          how it compares and where the information comes from.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon icon-compare"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <p class="card-index">01 / COMPARE</p>
          <h3>Compare like for like</h3>
          <p>Bring key specifications together in a consistent format, so important differences are easier to see.</p>
          <span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-card feature-card-accent">
          <div class="feature-icon icon-evidence"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <p class="card-index">02 / VERIFY</p>
          <h3>Understand the source</h3>
          <p>Keep technical values connected to their evidence, with a review process for unclear or conflicting details.</p>
          <span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon icon-discover"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <p class="card-index">03 / DISCOVER</p>
          <h3>Explore the full picture</h3>
          <p>Look beyond headline power figures to the transmission, PTO, hydraulics and working details.</p>
          <span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="data-section section-space" id="data">
    <div class="container data-layout">
      <div class="data-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-mark"></span> SPECIFICATIONS, WITH STRUCTURE</p>
        <h2>Every detail has<br /><em>a place and a source.</em></h2>
        <p>
          Different manufacturers describe similar specifications in different ways.
          The platform is being designed to organise those details without hiding
          important differences in measurement or terminology.
        </p>
        <ul class="principle-list">
          <li><span>01</span> Consistent technical categories</li>
          <li><span>02</span> Source and evidence traceability</li>
          <li><span>03</span> Human review for ambiguous values</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="spec-panel">
        <div class="panel-header">
          <div>
            <span class="panel-kicker">TECHNICAL PROFILE</span>
            <h3>Specification framework</h3>
          </div>
          <span class="panel-badge">STRUCTURED DATA</span>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-rows">
          <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-number">01</span><span class="spec-name">Engine & power</span><span class="spec-state">SPEC CATEGORY</span></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-number">02</span><span class="spec-name">Transmission</span><span class="spec-state">SPEC CATEGORY</span></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-number">03</span><span class="spec-name">PTO & hydraulics</span><span class="spec-state">SPEC CATEGORY</span></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-number">04</span><span class="spec-name">Dimensions & weight</span><span class="spec-state">SPEC CATEGORY</span></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-number">05</span><span class="spec-name">Lift capacity</span><span class="spec-state">SPEC CATEGORY</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-foot">
          <span class="panel-check">✓</span>
          <p>Values will be shown with their source context, not as unsupported estimates.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-grid-mark"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="approach-section section-space" id="approach">
    <div class="container approach-layout">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-mark"></span> OUR APPROACH</p>
        <h2>Useful data.<br /><em>Earned trust.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="approach-copy">
        <p>
          The goal is not to publish the biggest number of specifications.
          It is to make each published detail understandable and defensible.
        </p>
        <p>
          AI-assisted research can help locate manufacturer material and organise
          technical information. Unclear findings should be reviewed before they
          become part of the public catalogue.
        </p>
        <a class="text-link text-link-dark" href="#platform">See the platform principles <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container roadmap-strip">
      <div><span>01</span><strong>Discover</strong><small>Find technical sources</small></div>
      <div><span>02</span><strong>Structure</strong><small>Organise specifications</small></div>
      <div><span>03</span><strong>Review</strong><small>Resolve uncertainty</small></div>
      <div><span>04</span><strong>Compare</strong><small>Make details useful</small></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="closing-section">
    <div class="container closing-layout">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-mark"></span> THE NEXT GENERATION OF TRACTOR DATA</p>
        <h2>Know the machine.<br /><em>Choose with confidence.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <a class="button button-light" href="/tractors/">Explore the catalogue <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>